{
  "requirement": "Create a login form with username, password, and a submit button.",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你是 RenderJS 页面规格分析器。把用户需求转成 ComponentSpecDraft JSON。\n\n核心约束：\n- 单页单 gadget，状态驱动渲染\n- 不发明框架 API，不用全局 DOM\n- 信息不足时做最保守假设，优先最小可用页面\n- 不确定项写 uncertainties，待确认项写 todo_markers\n- 可退化功能写 allowed_degradation\n\n字段填写指引：\n- task_type: display|form|list|detail|dashboard|launcher|unknown\n- page_goal: 一句话说明页面目标\n- state_schema: 每个状态字段独立条目，给出 name/field_type/default/description。布尔状态用于 UI 切换（如 is_loading），字符串用于输入值和错误信息\n- events: 只列需要绑定的 DOM 事件（submit/click 等），不列生命周期\n- ui_plan: 按页面区域拆分，每个区域一个 component_kind\n- dom_requirements: 给出 selector_hint（.class 格式）和 element 标签\n- async_requirements: 仅当事件触发异步操作时填写\n- child_gadget_needs / acquisition_needs: 无需求时留空数组\n\n组件白名单：\npage, panel, section, form, fieldset, input, textarea, select, checkbox, radio, button, list, list_item, table, card, banner, notice, dialog, toolbar, tabs, pagination, empty_state, loading_state\n\n只输出 JSON，不输出其他文字"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "需求：\nCreate a login form with username, password, and a submit button. Show loading during submit and error on failure."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "{\"task_type\": \"form\", \"page_goal\": \"Login form with submit, loading, and error feedback.\", \"assumptions\": [\"Only username and password fields needed.\", \"Login request deferred to async implementation.\"], \"uncertainties\": [\"No spec for remember-me option.\", \"No spec for post-login destination.\"], \"degradation_policy\": {\"mode\": \"strict\", \"summary\": \"Block submit on missing input; show error on failure.\"}, \"ui_plan\": [{\"area_id\": \"login_form\", \"title\": \"Login Form\", \"component_kind\": \"form\", \"purpose\": \"Collect credentials and submit\"}, {\"area_id\": \"feedback\", \"title\": \"Feedback\", \"component_kind\": \"notice\", \"purpose\": \"Show error or status\"}], \"component_whitelist_used\": [\"page\", \"form\", \"input\", \"button\", \"notice\", \"loading_state\"], \"state_schema\": [{\"name\": \"username\", \"field_type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"Username input\"}, {\"name\": \"password\", \"field_type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"Password input\"}, {\"name\": \"is_submitting\", \"field_type\": \"boolean\", \"default\": false, \"required\": true, \"description\": \"Submit in progress\"}, {\"name\": \"error_message\", \"field_type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"Error text\"}], \"events\": [{\"name\": \"submit_login\", \"trigger\": \"submit\", \"source_area_id\": \"login_form\", \"handler_goal\": \"Validate and start login\", \"updates_state\": [\"is_submitting\", \"error_message\"], \"async_required\": true}], \"dom_requirements\": [{\"selector_hint\": \".login-form\", \"element\": \"form\", \"purpose\": \"Login inputs and submit button\", \"required\": true}, {\"selector_hint\": \".login-error\", \"element\": \"div\", \"purpose\": \"Error messages\", \"required\": true}], \"data_requirements\": [], \"async_requirements\": [{\"name\": \"login_request\", \"trigger\": \"submit_login\", \"success_state\": \"is_submitting=false\", \"error_state\": \"is_submitting=false,error_message=error\", \"fallback\": \"keep values and allow retry\"}], \"child_gadget_needs\": [], \"acquisition_needs\": [], \"allowed_degradation\": [{\"condition\": \"service unavailable\", \"fallback\": \"show error and allow retry\"}], \"todo_markers\": [\"Confirm post-login navigation.\"]}"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "需求：\nCreate a login form with username, password, and a submit button."
    }
  ],
